<title>USA: Panda Project signs VSPA licensing pact.</title>
<headline>Panda Project signs VSPA licensing pact.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Panda Project Inc. on Wednesday said Pantronix Corp has licensed Panda's VSPA Semiconductor Packaging Technology.</p>
<p>Terms of the licensing agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The VSPA package is designed to reduce the size and cost of standard semiconductor packages, while enhancing performance, lead counts and reliability, the company said.</p>
